---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="text-[11px] font-light tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-deep">About Sinclair</p>
        <div class="mt-6 h-px w-10 bg-deep/40"></div>
        <h2 class="mt-8 max-w-lg text-4xl leading-[1.2] text-charcoal sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
          style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 400;">
          Personal by nature.<br />Expert by connection.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-2xl lg:pt-16" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-xl font-light leading-[1.7] text-charcoal sm:text-2xl">
          A boutique company with a personal approach, Sinclair Yachting brings together thoughtful attention and expertise from across the yachting industry.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base font-light leading-[1.9] text-charcoal/70 sm:text-lg">
          Our extensive network connects us with exceptional specialists, trusted professionals and experienced teams. We hand-pick the right people for each client, matching their knowledge and strengths to your particular needs.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base font-light leading-[1.9] text-charcoal/70 sm:text-lg">
          From your first conversation to the finer details, you have a dedicated point of contact and a carefully chosen team behind you—so every service feels considered, seamless and personal.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
